<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Diagnostic cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Diagnostic cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns dropped the buy rating on U.S. Diagnostic Inc, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 2-9/16 to 9-1/2.</p>
